EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Congratulations! You have been awarded the ASU Scholastic Award of $1,000 per year, which is renewable three times, for four award years. You can view and accept this award in My ASU under the Finances tab at https://my.asu.edu.


Remember to keep checking your Priority Task list on My ASU for any items you need to complete before enrolling.


If you haven't done so already, your next step to becoming a Sun Devil is to pay your enrollment deposit (https://students.asu.edu/freshman/deposit) in My ASU. Once you submit your enrollment deposit, you will be able to complete your next steps, such as signing up for housing and for orientation, where you will register for classes.


I am happy to answer any questions you may have about your enrollment steps or your latest scholarship award.


Go Devils!

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
